---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="IP Camera Installation Kansas City | Commercial CCTV" description="Secure your Kansas City business with pro IP camera &amp; CCTV installation. $1M insured, no fluff. Call 816-787-2061 today to schedule a fast site survey!">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center; padding:7rem 2rem 3rem;">
        <h1>Commercial IP Camera Installation in Kansas City</h1>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:1.1rem; max-width:760px; margin:1rem auto 0;">Enterprise-grade 4K surveillance, clean structured cabling, and reliable NVR deployments tailored for Kansas City business owners.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:2rem; display:flex; gap:1rem; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ordering-system">Get a Quote / Order</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="tel:8167872061">Call 816-787-2061</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">What Is Included in Our Turnkey IP Camera Deployments</h2>
            <p class="anim" style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; max-width:820px;">Every business surveillance system we build is designed for maximum clarity, site reliability, and longevity. We install high-resolution 4K and 8MP commercial-grade IP cameras equipped with advanced nighttime infrared, wide dynamic range (WDR), and optical zoom capabilities to cover critical entryways, retail floors, loading docks, and parking lots. Every installation includes local or hybrid cloud Network Video Recorder (NVR) provisioning configured for continuous 24/7 recording and event-driven motion alerts without forced recurring SaaS fees.

We don't cut corners on the physical backbone. Installations feature solid-copper Cat6 plenum or riser cabling, neatly managed patch panels, Power-over-Ethernet (PoE) switches, and weatherproof conduit where needed. You receive full administrative credentials, local hardware access, and remote viewing configured across all your authorized desktop, iOS, and Android mobile devices.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">Why Kansas City Businesses Rely on Ultimate Security Solutions</h2>
            <p class="anim" style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; max-width:820px;">Ultimate Security Solutions LLC is a veteran-owned, Greater Kansas City low-voltage integrator delivering tactical, zero-fluff field execution. With over $1M in general liability insurance, we serve commercial facilities, warehouses, multi-tenant properties, and retail storefronts across Jackson, Johnson, Wyandotte, and Clay counties with precision and speed.

You work directly with an experienced field technician who understands low-voltage network topology, fire-barrier penetrations, and clean commercial aesthetic standards. We eliminate sales rep markup, show up on schedule with the right commercial equipment, and deliver clean, organized wire runs labeled to telecommunications standards.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">Straightforward Process and Transparent Pricing Guidance</h2>
            <p class="anim" style="color:var(--muted); line-height:1.8; max-width:820px;">Our installation workflow starts with a direct, comprehensive site walk to identify high-risk blind spots, mounting heights, network rack placement, and cable path routes. We provide a single fixed-price quote covering hardware, custom cable runs, mounting brackets, termination, NVR storage calculation, and full system configuration before any work begins.

Most small-to-midsize business camera projects range from $1,500 for compact 4-camera retail packages up to $15,000+ for multi-building commercial industrial arrays with PTZ tracking and access control integration. We bill clearly without surprise hourly overages, complete work with minimal operational downtime, and provide full end-user training upon final walkthrough.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section section-dark">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">PRICING — STARTING POINTS</h2>
            <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr)); gap:1rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">IP Camera System Installation</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $1200 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ system (4-8 cameras)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Access Control System</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $1800 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ door (reader + electric strike)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Low-Voltage Network Cabling</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $150 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ drop (Cat6, terminated &amp; tested)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Burglar Alarm System</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $950 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ system</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Structured Cabling / MDF-IDF Buildout</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $2500 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ closet</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Business Wi-Fi Deployment</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $1400 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ AP (incl. survey)</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="card" style="border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:1.2rem;">
                <h3 style="font-size:0.95rem;">Site Survey / Security Consulting</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; margin:0.4rem 0;">from $500 <span style="font-weight:400; color:var(--muted); font-size:0.8rem;">/ visit</span></p>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title anim">FAQ</h2>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Can I view my business security cameras remotely on my phone?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Yes. We configure encrypted remote viewing on your iOS, Android, and PC workstations with zero monthly software subscriptions required.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">Do you install customer-supplied cameras or provide full turn-key hardware?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">We do both. We can engineer and supply enterprise-grade NDAA-compliant LTS/Hikvision/UniFi hardware or install and terminate equipment you have already purchased.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">What areas in the Greater Kansas City metro do you service?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">We cover the entire KC metro within a 100-mile radius, including Independence, Overland Park, Lee's Summit, Olathe, Kansas City MO/KS, Blue Springs, and Liberty.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding:14px 0;">
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-bottom:0.4rem;">How quickly can you schedule a commercial site survey and installation?</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.7;">Site assessments are typically scheduled within 24 to 48 hours. Most 4-to-16 camera commercial deployments are completed within 1 to 3 business days.</p>
        </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:0.85rem;">Ultimate Security Solutions LLC — Kansas City, MO · Licensed · Bonded · $1M Insured</p>
        </div>
    </section>
</Page>
